WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:08.850
Enter a bill from a supplier, approve it, and see what is due to whom and when.

2
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:14.590
Payables shows what the mall owes its suppliers, and which bills are overdue.

3
00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:19.110
Choose New bill.

4
00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:22.490
Choose the supplier.

5
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:30.580
Type the supplier's own invoice number, so it is never entered twice.

6
00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:36.210
On each line, the expense account. Here, cleaning.

7
00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:43.240
What it is for.

8
00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:47.380
And the amount before VAT.

9
00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:52.680
The VAT rate. The office adds the VAT and the total.

10
00:00:52.680 --> 00:01:01.970
Save and approve. The bill is posted to the books and waits to be paid by its due date.

11
00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:09.010
Bills from a purchase order are created from the order itself, and checked against what was received.
